The fix now gives the palette 12px side margins on phones, places descriptions beneath their labels, and uses a short mobile search prompt. Desktop keeps the 512px panel and its horizontal rows.

I’ve added browser checks for all three widths, including content overflow, scrolling, search, and navigation. Chromium is blocked by macOS sandbox permissions, and no existing browser connection is available, so I can’t yet provide verified screenshots. Lint and TypeScript checks are running.
